<title>USA: Triteal names Chen president, COO.</title>
<headline>Triteal names Chen president, COO.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, Calif. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>TriTeal Corp said it named David Chen as president and chief operating officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Chen will report to Chairman and Chief Executive Officer Jeff Witous, who previously served as president.</p>
<p>Company officials were not available to say whether the COO post was previously vacant.</p>
<p>Chen founded Ascent Group, a management consulting firm providing strategic consulting services to Fortune 500 companies.</p>
